   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food crisis response team</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is an expansion of the project that took place in November &quot;Political Innovation Lab&quot; (&#x201c;PIL&#x201d;) that was carried out within the framework of Juventud Socialista de Argentina (&#x201c;JSA&#x201d;)&#x2019; Young Leaders&apos; Political Training School. Based on &#x201c;PIL&#x201d; we want to work further on our corporation. With this specific project we want to focus on how JSA can work within their organisation with different methods and tools to engage young people to fight ongoing food insecurity. With this project we will be able to bring each other knowledge about organisation structures through training and field work. Furthermore, our planned training and field work with members will also strengthen the members&apos; possibilities to seek influence. The target group is first of all members of JSA that will be trained in the first phase</narrative>
  </description>
